.TH CRUNCH_VSERVER 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_vserver \- Linux x86-64 syscall 236
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B long crunch_vserver(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the obsolete vserver syscall slot, unimplemented on Linux x86-64; policy may return a different error.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vserver (2)
